<title>MEXICO: ICA wins 101 mln peso subway contracts.</title>
<headline>ICA wins 101 mln peso subway contracts.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican builder Empresas ICA Sociedad Controladora SA de CV said on Wednesday it won two contracts worth about 101 million pesos for construction on a Mexico City subway line.</p>
<p>Work on the line will begin at the end of the month and is scheduled for completion by November 1999.  The projects are an addition to the company's work on the line since January 1995, ICA said in a statement.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
